# Atlas Core: Expressive Component Design Token Architecture
**Author:** Sable Petrov  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D16 07:40  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Complete semantic and component token specifications for Atlas Core, translated from the brand ethos and service blueprints in the Company Document to bridge digital SaaS interactions with face-to-face emotional resonance.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://tokens.spec.atlas.io/v1/schema.json",
  "metadata": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "designer": "Sable Petrov",
    "governance": "Aligned directly with the service standards and brand architecture detailed in Company Document to ensure continuous tactile empathy across digital SaaS touchpoints and face-to-face client encounters."
  },
  "component": {
    "card": {
      "surface": {
        "value": "{color.surface.warm-canvas}",
        "description": "A welcoming, grounded foundation derived from the Company Document's human-first hospitality directives."
      },
      "border": {
        "value": "1px solid {color.stroke.subtle-intimacy}",
        "radius": "{radii.lg}"
      },
      "elevation": {
        "resting": "{shadow.ambient.soft-glow}",
        "hover": "{shadow.elevation.embraced}"
      },
      "motion": {
        "transition": "all {motion.duration.deliberate} {motion.easing.natural-breath}"
      }
    },
    "button": {
      "primary": {
        "background": {
          "default": "{color.brand.resonant-indigo}",
          "hover": "{color.brand.deep-twilight}"
        },
        "padding": "{spacing.sm} {spacing.xl}",
        "radii": "{radii.pill}",
        "typography": "{font.action.poetic-medium}"
      }
    },
    "interaction": {
      "focusRing": {
        "width": "2px",
        "style": "solid",
        "color": "{color.accessibility.clear-embrace}",
        "offset": "2px"
      }
    }
  }
}
```